{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python - <<'PY'\nimport json\nartifact='b72d7349b9bd42a09cb59cf43a06a40f';run='fd01442675f846f1a5adc7de29ea3b7d'\ns=dict(action='review',artifact_id=artifact,rationale='Review fixed producer/codec check as a whole against C-prepare-value-ballot v1, preserving local scope and contrary recovery evidence.',review_items=[dict(aspect='checker_correspondence',status='no_issue_found',source_ids=['S-recovery','S-reply-type','S-reply-wire','S-send','S-receive','S-init','S-base','S-formation','S-broadcast'],rationale='Inspected fixed plan and harness under direct-checks/90b0c970a398426d91118919c8b2284e and current execution fd01442675f846f1a5adc7de29ea3b7d. The required relationship is the accepted local message-fidelity obligation, derived from handlePrepare reporting inst.vbal separately from joined bal and handlePrepareReply selecting prior state using VBallot. Harness does not assert that a preaccepted command must win recovery. Its bounded manual initialization reproduces fields actually used by these synchronous entries: empty instance rows, -1 frontiers, conflict maps, stats, N=3/F=1, volatile mode and cyclic preferred peers. Real handlePropose produces row 1 instance 0 PreAccept at ballot 1, decoded and consumed by actual handlePreAccept. The measured live instance prerequisite is nonnil, command-bearing and preaccepted with vbal 1. Actual startRecoveryForInstance emits Prepare ballot 3; explicit invocation replaces scanner timing, which is outside the obligation. Recipient handles this generated message and sends the response through actual SendMsg/Marshal. Writer buffers replace sockets without byte or field modification; the selected stream has exactly one PrepareReply. Reading the live inst.vbal after synchronous handlePrepare is a valid producer observation because that handler changes bal, not vbal, and directly copies inst.vbal into the response before returning. No concurrent mutation occurs. New/Unmarshal matches listener allocation and codec behavior. producer is the explicit admission alias; command_count/status prerequisite is independent of compared VBallot. acceptor/replica/instance identity uniquely pairs the sole input and result, without filtering on ballot or VBallot. Result decoding completed successfully and independently emitted the decoded field. Current output is producer vballot 1 and decoded vballot 0, with acceptor 2/row 1/instance 0, ballot 3, status 2 and command count 1 on both. The monitor compares actual result to producer.vballot; process PASS is not used as the oracle. Stop is after decode, independent of whether comparison holds. No resource lifecycle or pending message drain is needed for this synchronous codec scope. The measured mismatch corresponds to the bound codec omission and resolves the narrow preservation question.',counterevidence=['Ballot, status, command count and identity agree; only the checked prior-value ballot differs.','Zero-valued VBallot inputs would coincide with the default and are not evidence of preservation for nonzero input.','Earlier exploration restarted a NOOP, but its independent self-reply relabeling prevents codec-only causal attribution.'],limitations=['No real listener goroutine, TCP connection or automatic scanner trigger executes; the same codecs and sender run on captured bytes.','No cluster agreement, accepted-decision loss, client outcome or crash-restart consequence is established.','One preaccepted producer history is measured; no universal protocol coverage claim.'],report_title='恢复回复的值选票在传输中丢失',report_answer='固定检查中，接受者经真实 PreAccept 建立的值选票为 1；真实 Prepare 回复经序列化和解码后变为 0。同一回复的身份、当前选票、状态和命令数量一致。结论仅限字段保真责任，不证明集群共识安全被破坏。')],feedback=dict(ref_ids=[artifact,run,'479b78003ae14c8e9e80a639cf8a0066','B-wire'],answered='Fresh fixed execution measured decoded VBallot 0 against producer vbal 1 for the same reply; current